  m_text: "1.  SPLIT halves every run, until each block stands alone.\n2.  Merge two neighbouring runs:  compare their two FRONT blocks and move the smaller one down into the merge row.\n3.  When one run is empty, the rest of the other follows.\n4.  Runs of 1 \u2192 2 \u2192 4 \u2192 8.\n\n<i>One block on its own is always sorted.</i>"
