--- !u!114 &650782172
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 650782171}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c0fff7bf7c8fc4f1a8bc4d734d577dfb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SortOrStay.BuildingManager
  floors:
  - number: 1
    title: "FLOOR 1  \xB7  THE LOCKED ROOM"
    roomName: The Locked Room
    objective: "Sort the 6 keys from <b>smallest to largest</b>, the bubble sort way.\nCompare the <b>glowing pair</b>:  <b>swap</b> if the left key is bigger, otherwise they <b>stay</b>.\n<size=20>Pick up a glowing key, then click its neighbour (swap) or the same key (stay)  \xB7  hook numbers 1-6  \xB7  H hint</size>"
    lines:
    - Floor 1.  The Locked Room.
    puzzle: {fileID: 1531385658}
    exitDoor: {fileID: 1853679065}
    entrance: {fileID: 0}
    root: {fileID: 1232528245}
    spawn: {x: 0, y: 20, z: -0.90000033}
    spawnYaw: 0
    roomMin: {x: -3, y: 20, z: -2.0000002}
    roomMax: {x: 3, y: 23, z: 5}
    pathOut:
    - {x: 0, y: 20, z: 3.9}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 20, z: 6}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 17.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 17.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 15, z: 6.2999997}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 15, z: 4.3}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 15, z: 3.1}
  - number: 2
    title: "FLOOR 2  \xB7  THE STORAGE ROOM"
    roomName: The Storage Room
    objective: "Sort the crates <b>light to heavy</b> into bays 1-7.\nEach pass: <b>weigh every crate that's left</b>, then send the <b>lightest</b> to the next bay.\n<size=20>Click a crate or press its bay number (1-7)  \xB7  Q weighs them all  \xB7  H hint</size>"
    lines:
    - Floor 2.  A storage room, full of daylight.
    - Seven crates on seven scales... and every reading is blank.
    - Light to heavy.  Find the lightest, every single pass.
    puzzle: {fileID: 114032640}
    exitDoor: {fileID: 1973022688}
    entrance: {fileID: 1414889625}
    root: {fileID: 1513408777}
    spawn: {x: 2.8, y: 15, z: 3.6}
    spawnYaw: 180
    roomMin: {x: -5, y: 15, z: -5}
    roomMax: {x: 5, y: 19.4, z: 5}
    pathOut:
    - {x: 0, y: 15, z: 3.9}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 15, z: 6}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 12.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 12.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 10, z: 6.2999997}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 10, z: 4.3}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 10, z: 3.1}
  - number: 3
    title: "FLOOR 3  \xB7  THE LIBRARY"
    roomName: The Library
    objective: "<b>Insertion sort</b> the books on the shelf, smallest number first.\nPull out the glowing book;  <b>shift</b> a bigger left neighbour right (click it),  or <b>place</b> the book (click it).\n<size=20>Click the glowing book or press F  \xB7  click the glowing spot or press its number  \xB7  H hint</size>"
    lines:
    - Floor 3.  A library, warm and quiet.
    - Eight books on the return shelf, all out of order.
    - Sort them where they stand, one book at a time.
    puzzle: {fileID: 960731190}
    exitDoor: {fileID: 1160495293}
    entrance: {fileID: 1346144698}
    root: {fileID: 2097378265}
    spawn: {x: 2.8, y: 10, z: 3.6}
    spawnYaw: 180
    roomMin: {x: -5, y: 10, z: -4}
    roomMax: {x: 5, y: 13.8, z: 5}
    pathOut:
    - {x: 0, y: 10, z: 3.9}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 10, z: 6}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 7.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 7.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 5, z: 6.2999997}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 5, z: 4.3}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 5, z: 3.1}
  - number: 4
    title: "FLOOR 4  \xB7  THE CONTROL ROOM"
    roomName: The Control Room
    objective: "<b>Merge sort</b> the data blocks, smallest first.\nPress <b>SPLIT</b> until every block stands alone.  Then merge two runs at a time:  always take the <b>smaller front block</b>.\n<size=20>Q split  \xB7  click a glowing front block, or press 1 (left) / 2 (right)  \xB7  H hint</size>"
    lines:
    - Floor 4.  A control room, humming quietly.
    - Eight data blocks, scrambled.  One console to merge them.
    - Split them all apart, then merge them back, two runs at a time.
    puzzle: {fileID: 1131596825}
    exitDoor: {fileID: 399417106}
    entrance: {fileID: 1421030769}
    root: {fileID: 766475026}
    spawn: {x: 2.8, y: 5, z: 3.6}
    spawnYaw: 180
    roomMin: {x: -5.5, y: 5, z: -5}
    roomMax: {x: 5.5, y: 9, z: 5}
    pathOut:
    - {x: 0, y: 5, z: 3.9}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 5, z: 6}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 2.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 2.5, z: 11.22}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 0, z: 6.2999997}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 0, z: 4.3}
    - {x: 2.8, y: 0, z: 3.1}
  - number: 5
    title: "FLOOR 5  \xB7  THE FINAL VAULT"
    roomName: The Final Vault
    objective: "<b>Quick sort</b> the gold bars, smallest first.\nRaise the <b>pivot</b> (the last bar).  Every other bar:  <b>smaller</b> goes behind the gate,  <b>bigger</b> stays.  Then drop the pivot into its place.\n<size=20>P pivot  \xB7  1 smaller  \xB7  2 bigger  \xB7  H hint</size>"
    lines:
    - 'Floor 5.  The vault:  the last door between you and the street.'
    - Eight gold bars, out of order.  The vault opens only for a sorted row.
    - Pick a pivot, split the rest around it, and do it again.
    puzzle: {fileID: 580141422}
    exitDoor: {fileID: 70658671}
    entrance: {fileID: 32815653}
    root: {fileID: 1457261801}
    spawn: {x: 2.8, y: 0, z: 3.6}
    spawnYaw: 180
    roomMin: {x: -5.5, y: 0, z: -5}
    roomMax: {x: 5.5, y: 4.6, z: 5}
    pathOut:
    - {x: 0, y: 0, z: 3.9}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 0, z: 6.1}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 0, z: 11.719999}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 0, z: 13.419999}
    - {x: 0.099999964, y: 0, z: 15.019999}
  player: {fileID: 998381866}
  intro: {fileID: 650782174}
